    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8634" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">clīvōsus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		clivus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hilly</i>, <i>full of hills</i>, <i>steep</i> (<b>poet.</b> or in post-Aug.
			prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 212</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trames,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 108</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loci et aridi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. Arb. 4, 3</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opp. planus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. R. R. 2, 16, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					18, 24, 55, § 200</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olympus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					3, 415</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Am. 1, 14, 11</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tramite vitae,</span>”
				<i>steep</i>, <i>difficult</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					6, 120</span></i>
			.</div>
